@startuml
title Add Comment sequence
scale 0.85
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam maxMessageSize 55
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantPadding 10
  BoxPadding 8
  MessageAlign center
  ArrowThickness 1
}
actor User
participant "Stays4Pilgrims Frontend" as FE
participant "Stays4Pilgrims Backend - CommentsController" as API
participant "CommentsService" as SVC
participant "ContentModerationService" as MOD
database "CommentsRepo / DB" as DB

User -> FE: Write comment + rating\nand submit
FE -> API: POST /comments/handle\n{action:'add', payload:{AccomodationId, accountId, comment, rating}}
activate API
API -> SVC: add({AccomodationId, accountId, comment, rating})
activate SVC
SVC -> MOD: moderateComment(comment)
activate MOD
MOD --> SVC: moderation result\n{decision, reason, target:'comment'}
deactivate MOD
alt moderation rejected
  SVC --> API: throw BadRequest (comment rejected)
  deactivate SVC
  API --> FE: 400 Bad Request {reason}
  deactivate API
  return
end
SVC -> DB: check account exists
activate DB
DB --> SVC: account or not found
deactivate DB
SVC -> DB: check Accomodation exists & is approved
activate DB
DB --> SVC: Accomodation or not found
deactivate DB
SVC -> DB: create Comment\n{accountId, AccomodationId, comment, rating, status:'pending'}
activate DB
DB --> SVC: saved comment entity
deactivate DB
SVC --> API: return created CommentDto
deactivate SVC
API --> FE: 201 Created\n{commentId, rating, comment, status:'pending', author}
deactivate API
FE --> User: Show comment in list (pending approval)

note over SVC,MOD: Comments are moderated\nfor spam and abusive content
note over DB: Status flow:\npending -> approved/rejected

@enduml

